            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Your home is now a canvas of space cards. A card stays exactly where you put it and never changes size; a space you use more shows as a thicker stack with a richer face. New and small ideas wait in a tray at the bottom until you place or pin them. Every board now grows outward from its middle, so work the AI puts to the left or above lands there without pushing anything, and the two-arrows button brings you back to the middle of your work. It is on for your account first, and includes everything in build 201.
]]></description>
